### A discontinuous Galerkin formulation

In a DG formulation, we approximate the solution:

\f{eqnarray*}{
  \int_{\partial \text{cell}_{\psi _\phi }} (n \cdot \phi) \psi _\phi dS(x)  
  & \approx & 
  \int_{\partial \text{cell}_{\psi _\phi }} [[ \phi ]] \psi _\phi dS(x)  
  \\
  \int _{\partial \text{cell}_{\psi _u}}  u \cdot (n, \psi _u) dS(x)
  & \approx & 
  \int _{\partial \text{cell}_{\psi _u}}  u \cdot (n, \psi _u) dS(x)
\f$


